    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hana walombeli nindi, Muchima wami hiwukuluŋa naYehova, luseŋu lwami analunyamuni dehi kwiwulu mudi Yehova. Hinukudisama mukanwa kami chakuseha ayilumbu jami; nanichi chinazaŋalalina wamwinu weyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hosi wajila wakweseka naYehovaku. Hikwekala wacheŋuku, yeyi hohu. Niilola dacheŋi dakweseka naNzambi yetu kwosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi muhosha cheŋi nakudinka wanta chochochuku. Bayi mudisansula mukanwaku. Muloŋa Yehova hiNzambi weluka, diyi wesekaŋa mwakoŋaŋawu antu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayilobu anayikotweli mata awu, hakwinza ana adiŋi nakudimbuka anayivwiki Ŋovu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adiŋi ekuta hiyakuya nakukwata nyidimu kulonda amoni yakudya, hakwinza atiyili nzala, nzala yawu yinamweni dehi. Mwalala nshintanavwali dehi anyana atanu nayedi, hakwinza wukweti anyana amavulu hakuzeya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova welaŋa ajaha, ahandisha; ashikili kwijamu, asaŋula cheŋi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova welaŋahutwisha, ahetesha; atwala kwishina, anyamunakwiwulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diyi wanonaŋa kazwepi hamaseki, diyi wanyamunaŋa wabula yumakwizalelu, hakuyishakamisha hamu nawayilolu, akaswani itanda dawanta dalema. Muloŋa yishimi yakwatishaŋa iseki yambala yaYehova hohu, dihu hemikayi mpata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakahembaŋa nyendu yawantu indi ajila, hakwila atama wakayimweneshela mumwidima. Kwosi muntu wakabadika akwawu naŋovu jinduku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alwaŋa naYehova akayikotola kotu-kotu. Wakayivumina mwiwulu. Yehova wakasompesha insa jamaseki. Wakamwinka Ŋovu mwanta wanadi ishiyi wanta. Wakanyamuna kwiwulu luseŋu lwawindi awayishawu dehi manji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elekana wayili kwitala dindi kuRama. Mwana wamukalakeleli Yehova kumesu akapristu Eli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaEli adiŋi antu amukunkulwayi, hiyamwilukili Yehovaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atupristu elilaŋa antu neyi kukwinza muntu nakuketula chimuna, neyimbiji yinayili dehi, ŋamba yakapristu hakwinza nangutu yanyisomu yisatu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hakuyishimika mumeŋa, hela mushalela, hela mulunuŋu lweneni, helamwinuŋu, yejima yikulamata kungutu yikufuma mwinuŋu kapristu hakutambulahiyindi, dichi chayililaŋawu aIsarela ejima kuShilo kwayilaŋawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela neyi anakeŋi kushita manji, ŋamba yakapristu hakwinza nakumwila muntu naketuli chimuna, nindi, Nyinki mbiji yaku mwochela kapristu, yena hanakeŋi eyi kumwinka mbiji yakutelekaku, chiŋa yayisu hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi owu muntu wukumwila nindi, Keŋa ashiti manji katataka, neyianashiti dehi wukutambula tuhu mbiji yejima yiwunakeŋi mumuchimaweyi, pamba hakumwila nindi, Nehi, chiŋa wunyinka katataka, neyi nehi, nukutambula naŋovu jami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nshidi yawanyikwenzi owu yaswejelikutoha kumesu aYehova, muloŋa antu adiwili himulambu waYehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samweli wakalakeli kumesu aYehova, iku wuchidi mwana, wavwalaifwodi yehina dadiwahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mama yindi welilaŋa amuchimina kachikovwelu kanyanya, hakumusendelaŋa hamwaka hamwaka hayilaŋayi nanfumwindi nakuketula chimuna chahamwaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eli wakiswilili Elekana naŋodindi nkisu, nindi, Yehova akwinki anyana naniwu mumbanda nanichi chiwuna musondamishi Yehova. Hiyakuya nikumukala wawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamuhempwili Hana, wabaabili mavumu, wavweli anyana amayala asatu, ambanda ayedi. Owu mwana Samweli wakulilili kumesu aYehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eli waswejeli kukula nankashi, watiyili yuma yejima yayikoŋela ŋawu aIsarela kudi anyanindi, nichi chakamina ŋawu nawambanda apompelaŋa kuchisu chetenti dakubulakena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayilili nindi, Mwakoŋela ŋadi yumiyi? Natiyi nsaŋu jenu jatama kudi antu awa ejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinjila, enu anyanami, iyi nsaŋu yinukutiya hiyayiwahuku. Mudi nakuluwisha antu ambala aYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi muntu wukuvulumuna mukwawu muntu akamusompe shakudi Nzambi; indi neyi muntu amuvulumuna Yehova wakamuhakwilaku hinyi? Ilaŋa wena kwawu kutiyilila mwizu datata yawu nehi, muloŋa Yehova welili nindi ayijahi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owu mwana Samweli wayilaŋa nakukula hohu, amutiyili kuwaha nikudi Yehova nikudi antu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudi Eli kwenjili muntu waNzambi, wamwilili nindi, Tiya chanahoshiyi Yehova, nindi, Hadiŋuwu akwamutaŋa watata yeyi muEjipitu muwuduŋu kudi akwamutaŋa waFwaro hinadimwekesheli kudi wenaku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinamutondeli mukachi kanyichidi yawaIsarela yejima, nami akeli kapristukami, nami akaketulaŋa yimuna hakameŋa kami, akochaŋa insensi, akavwalaŋa ifwodi kumesu amuku? Akwamutaŋa watata yeyi hinayinkeli nyilambuyawanyana kaIsarela yejima yakwila nakesuku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indi ochu mwadatolela ŋadi yimuna yami nihimulambu wami wunayilejeli nami akaletaŋa mwitala dami? Eyi hiwukulemesha anyaneyi abadikami, himukuditohesha wupumananyilambu yawantu ami aIsarela yejima yabadika kuwaha! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu Yehova Nzambi yawaIsarela nahoshi nindi, Nahosheli chalala nami, Nimutaŋa weyi nimutaŋa watata yeyi akendaŋa kumesu ami haya nyaka. Ichi dinu Yehova nahoshi nindi, Aha-a kwami! Kwakulehi ntahi! Akunlemesha diwu nukulemesha, akundiwula akayisekesha tuhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya, mafuku akenza nakakufumisha Ŋovu jeyi, niŋovu jamutaŋa watata yeyi, kumutaŋa weyi hikwakamwekana wakashika kuwushinakajuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakamonaŋa mukwankunyi mwitala dami, mwejima mwamba kayiheteshela ŋayi Nzambi aIsarela. Kumutaŋa weyi hikwamba kamwekana muntu wambakashika kuwushinakajuku haya nyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu weyi nakalekela kukameŋa kami wakela wakukwiyilisha mumesu nakudila, wakukutiyisha mumuchimabwi. Antu ejima amba kavwalika kumutaŋa weyi akafwaŋa muwukwenziwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya chinjikijilu chiwakamona, chakamo nawu anyaneyi ayedi, aHofwini naFwinehasi; akafwa ifuku dawu dimu mwayedi wawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakadimwena kapristu kami washinshika, wakela mwaya muchima wami, nimwaya yitoŋojoka yami, nakanamutuŋisha mukala walala. Wakendaŋa haya nyaka kumesu awami nawayisha dehi manji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowu wakashalahuku mutaŋa weyi wakenza nakumufukamina nakumulomba kadali helakakudya, wakamwila nindi, Anyinkuhu mwani kamudimu kawupristu, nimwenuku twakudya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
